kMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布GPT-5.6大模型并深度绑定微软Microsoft 365 Copilot</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta携手博通与台积电，自研AI数据中心处理器Iris将于9月正式量产</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌升级Android Bench代码排行榜并开源Harbor框架，Claude 5位居榜首</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3fc09486f16128f01f5d36f1b4e2636b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于7月9日宣布升级Android Bench代码开发者排行榜，全面引入Harbor沙箱框架，并将该基准测试在GitHub开源。此次升级旨在通过安全隔离环境简化评估流程，支持社区提交自定义任务。在最新测定排名中，Anthropic旗下Claude Fable 5以84.5%的准确率位列榜首，OpenAI的GPT-5.5以80.2%位居次席，谷歌Gemini 3.1 Pro仅排第五。性能数据揭示，尽管Gemini 3.1 Pro单次迭代成本约为87美元，低于顶级模型的130美元，但Gemini 3.5 Flash在处理百题数据集时表现欠佳，单次运行耗时达28小时且成本高达165美元。此次评测结果显示谷歌在移动开发基准测试中面临技术挑战，而Android Bench正凭借Harbor框架的开放性与客观透明的机制，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果正评估PrismML原生1-bit模型压缩技术，拟提升iPhone端侧AI推理性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/21b4950880151a7a617ad647002b3a2b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司正接洽AI初创公司PrismML，评估其原生1-bit模型压缩技术在iPhone端侧运行大规模AI模型的可行性。PrismML的核心技术通过将模型权重压缩至仅含负1和正1的1-bit表示，在不保留高精度逃生通道的前提下，将模型体积缩减至全精度版本的约十四分之一，内存占用降低超90%。实测显示，该技术使推理速度最高提升8倍，能耗降低75%至80%。目前，PrismML已成功将阿里巴巴开源的27B参数Qwen 3.6模型在iPhone 17 Pro上完整运行，且保持了接近FP16的推理精度。若该技术落地，iPhone有望在不增加硬件成本的前提下，实现更复杂的多轮对话、图像理解及智能体任务编排，显著增强Apple Intelligence的端侧算力上限，改变端侧与云端AI的性能平衡。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-5.6大模型并深度绑定微软Microsoft 365 Copilot</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0abdab7b4d7ad50812eef5efd682ce06.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月9日，OpenAI正式发布全新GPT-5.6大模型，并明确该模型将作为Microsoft 365 Copilot的“首选模型”，全面支持Word、Excel、PowerPoint及Cowork等生产力应用。此次深度集成不仅实现了双方产品线的功能升级，更以实际行动回应了近期关于微软拟引入自研“MAI”模型以替代OpenAI、双方关系破裂的市场传闻。OpenAI官方强调，双方将持续深化战略协同，共同推动先进AI技术的普及。在xAI发布Grok 4.5、Meta推出Muse Spark 1.1等竞品加剧行业博弈的背景下，OpenAI与微软通过技术与场景的深度绑定，进一步巩固了生态壁垒。尽管双方合作的具体边界尚未完全披露，但此次发布明确了生态协同仍是当前生成式AI巨头构筑竞争优势的核心策略，对全球AI产业格局演变具</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta携手博通与台积电，自研AI数据中心处理器Iris将于9月正式量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a888e54478a5ec44d449e7d667c3695a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正与博通及台积电合作，计划于2026年9月正式量产代号为“Iris”的自研AI数据中心处理器。该芯片隶属于Meta定制化自主基础设施（MTIA）项目，已通过六周的初始漏洞测试。Iris的核心职能是优化Facebook与Instagram的内容排序、推荐系统及生成式算法，旨在降低数据中心成本并减少对第三方GPU的依赖。为保障供应链安全，Meta已与三星、闪迪及住友电气签署长期供应合同。Meta计划在2026年底前部署约7吉瓦计算容量，并于2027年翻倍至14吉瓦，为此2026年基础设施资本支出将达145亿美元。尽管Iris目前定位为NVIDIA和AMD GPU的补充，但Meta采取每六个月迭代一次的激进节奏，旨在通过自研硬件提升部署自主权，构建不依赖外部软硬件钳制的独立AI生态。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
